cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference cockpit for Claude Code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "cockpit for Claude Code"
abstract: >-
  cockpit is a Claude Code plugin that puts context usage and session cost in
  the status line, adds a budget alert and a /cockpit dashboard with rate limits
  and MCP server health, and blocks rm -rf and other recursive deletes in
  Dropbox, iCloud Drive, Google Drive and OneDrive folders.
authors:
